Other sealed metrics, selected against additive: pearson_delta without own targets 0.712 against 0.711. No stored sealed score to check for EXP_0671 (scored on the sealed set here first). Shared genes: on the visible validation perturbations the overlap-robust SE is 1.08 times the plain paired SE (63 perturbations, 42 genes, 416 ordered pairs sharing a gene); the leave-one-gene-out jackknife first specified, which exceeds 1 even for independent pairs, gives 1.44; the arm reading inflates the sealed SE by the first when above 1.

